</given-names></name><name><surname>Paroutoglou</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kountouras</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><chapter-title>Long-term botulinum toxin treatment for dysphagia due to large epiphrenic diverticulum in elderly patients: a report of two cases</chapter-title><source>Dysphagia</source><comment>in press</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18633569</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>